            "text": "{\"businessDate\":\"2025-11-11\",\"showtimes\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-16096\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-11-11\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-11-11T15:20:00+00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-11-11T17:38:00+00:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-11-11T15:45:00+00:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-11-11T17:38:00+00:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"RIC1-1-6\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006544\",\"siteId\":\"RIC1\",\"screenId\":\"RIC1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"RIC1-108-HO00006544\"},{\"id\":\"RIC1-15537\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-11-11\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-11-11T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-11-11T20:36:00+00:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-11-11T18:55:00+00:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-11-11T20:36:00+00:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"RIC1-1-6\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006300\",\"siteId\":\"RIC1\",\"screenId\":\"RIC1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"restrictions\":[],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":null},{\"id\":\"RIC1-16097\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-11-11\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-11-11T20:50:00+00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-11-11T23:08:00+00:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-11-11T21:15:00+00:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-11-11T23:08:00+00:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"RIC1-1-6\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006544\",\"siteId\":\"RIC1\",\"screenId\":\"RIC1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"RIC1-108-HO00006544\"}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Richmond\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.4593,\"longitude\":-0.307},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"Water Lane,\",\"line2\":\"Richmond,\",\"city\":\"TW9 1TJ\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006300\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: Caravaggio\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Five years in production, this is the most extensive film ever made about one of the greatest artists of all time – Caravaggio. Featuring masterpiece after masterpiece and with first-hand testimony from the artist himself on the eve of his mysterious disappearance, this beautiful new film reveals Caravaggio as never before.\\n\\nMulti-award-winning filmmakers David Bickerstaff and Phil Grabsky delve into the hidden narratives of Caravaggio’s life, piecing together clues embedded within his incredible art. The intriguing self-depictions within his works — sometimes disguised, sometimes in plain sight — offer a rare window into his psyche and personal struggles. Join us as we unravel the story of one of history’s most brilliant, complex and controversial figures.\\n\\nCaravaggio’s masterpieces are some of art’s most instantly recognisable. No one else uses his signature blend of dramatic light, intense naturalism and bold, striking figures. His incredible paintings have captivated audiences for centuries. But there lies a deeper mystery — one that still beckons us to explore. What do these masterpieces reveal about the man behind the brush?  Join us as we explore the intriguing clues that help us to finally understand the life – and death – of this remarkable man.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Mystery, intrigue, beauty, passion, murder – shine a new light on Caravaggio in this dramatic biography…\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"moderate bad language, sex references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P4bzA9uNXEU\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000511\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001432\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5aac82d0-2a7d-4a78-82e5-db6f1998af38\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006300\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007773\",\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"distributorName\":\"Seventh Art Productions\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006544\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Choral\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. The Choral’s ambitious committee, determined to press ahead, decides to recruit local young males to swell their ranks. They must also engage a new chorus master, and despite their suspicions that he has something to hide, their best bet seems to be Dr. Henry Guthrie (Ralph Fiennes) – driven, uncompromising, and recently returned from a career in Germany. As conscription papers start to arrive, the whole community discovers that the best response to the chaos that is laying waste to their lives is to make music together.\\n\\n \\n\\nDirected by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner NICHOLAS HYTNER (The Crucible) and written by BAFTA, Olivier and Tony Award winner ALAN BENNETT, The Choral marks their fourth writer-director collaboration following the acclaimed films The Madness of King George, The History Boys, and The Lady in The Van.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"1916. As war rages on the Western Front, the Choral Society in Ramsden, Yorkshire has lost most of its men to the army. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate sex\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-11-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":113,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6zRVP-ZgMm8\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002005\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002637\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003200\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003976\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012489\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012490\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"11244\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"f1ef9670-f7cd-4a13-bd6c-bd711489b3b6\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006544\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008085\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000511\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"David \",\"familyName\":\"Bickerstaff\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001432\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Phil\",\"familyName\":\"Grabsky\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001270\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ralph\",\"familyName\":\"Fiennes\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002005\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Nicholas \",\"familyName\":\"Hytner\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002637\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Simon Russell \",\"familyName\":\"Beale\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003200\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Kevin \",\"familyName\":\"Loader\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003976\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Damian \",\"familyName\":\"Jones\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000009275\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Robert\",\"familyName\":\"Emms\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000012489\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Roger\",\"familyName\":\"Allam\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000012490\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Alun\",\"familyName\":\"Armstrong\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"11244\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Mark\",\"familyName\":\"Addy\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000002\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Drama\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Drama\",\"translations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"0000000006\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Documentary\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"HO00000004\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"12A\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"12A\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[{\"id\":\"0000000009\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Screening followed by a Q&A\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"Q&A\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Q&A\",\"translations\":[]},\"importantMessage\":null,\"displayPriority\":100,\"isPromoted\":false}],\"screens\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Screen 1\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"0000000047\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Exhibition on Screen\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"EOS\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Working with top international museums and galleries, Exhibition on Screen create films which offer a cinematic immersion into the world’s best loved art, accompanied by insights from the world’s leading historians and arts critics. Executive Producer & Director Phil Grabsky has been making documentaries for over 30 years and is a multi award-winner. For the past 15 years he and award-winning director David Bickerstaff along with their colleagues have been both a major independent producer of arts films for TV as well as a pioneer (and largest producer) of cultural documentaries for the cinema.\\n\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-04-01\",\"endDate\":\"2099-12-31\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-108-HO00006544\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006544\",\"siteId\":\"RIC1\",\"bookingPeriods\":[{\"startsAt\":\"2025-10-17T00:01:00+01:00\",\"orderBookingModes\":[\"Paid\",\"Unpaid\",\"UnpaidConfirmed\"],\"restriction\":\"None\",\"rewardId\":null}]}],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}"
