-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":210,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000292\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b3549712-da50-415c-811f-783459340cae\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006228\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007685\",\"eventId\":\"0000000042\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"HO00000292\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Peter \",\"familyName\":\"Wright\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000004\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Live Opera, Music & Theatre\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Event\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"HO00000004\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"12A\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"12A\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[{\"id\":\"0000000006\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"importantMessage\":null,\"displayPriority\":100,\"isPromoted\":false}],\"screens\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Screen 1\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"0000000042\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"RB&O\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"The Royal Ballet and Opera brings the thrill of world-class theatre to cinema screens right around the globe. \\n\\nWith productions across both Companies, the programme includes beloved classics as well as new productions.\\n\\nOffering audiences a view from the best seat in the house, the programme shares the joy of live performance, and the beauty of world-class art with cinemagoers in more than 1,500 cinemas and 50 countries around the world.\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-09-01\",\"endDate\":\"2026-06-30\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"CAN2\",\"COL1\",\"HOX1\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"SOH1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}"
